       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-BIOMORPHIC-MEM.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BIOMORPHIC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CONTOUR-OK               PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CONTRAST-OK              PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MEMETIC-ATTRACTOR-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BIOMORPHIC-LATENCY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BIOMORPHIC-SEAL-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-BIOMORPHIC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PBM-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PBM-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-CONTOUR-AND-CONTRAST.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MEMETIC-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PBM-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-CONTOUR-AND-CONTRAST.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONTOUR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONTRAST-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MEMETIC-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MEMETIC-ATTRACTOR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BIOMORPHIC-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PBM-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CONTOUR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CONTRAST-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MEMETIC-ATTRACTOR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-BIOMORPHIC-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-BIOMORPHIC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PBM-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PBM-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PBM-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PBM-CODE.
